  "solution": "**Letter**\n\n \n \n \nA\n\n \n \n \nB\n\n \n \n \nC\n\n \n \n \nD\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\nGiven expression: 441 D 7 A 21 B 6 C (189 D 7) A (46 C 12)\n\nAfter replacing the letters by their meaning, we get:\n\n441 ÷ 7 + 21 × 6 - __**(189 **____**÷**____** 7)**__ + __**(46 - 12)**__\n\n= __**441 **____**÷**____** 7**__ + 21 × 6 - 27 + 34\n\n= 63 + __**21 **____**×**____** 6**__ - 27 + 34\n\n= __**63**____** + 126**__ - 27 __**+ 34**__\n\n= 223 - 27\n\n= 196\n\nHence, '**196**' is the correct answer.",
